# Cloudflare headers. Everything revalidates: Cloudflare attaches an ETag, so
# an unchanged file comes back 304 with no payload and a new deploy propagates
# at once -- no stale data.json after a rebuild.

# A page is requested as `/anys/1521/`, not as `.../index.html`, so the
# directory URLs need the rule as much as the files do.
/
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=0, must-revalidate
/*/
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=0, must-revalidate
/*.html
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=0, must-revalidate
/*.json
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=0, must-revalidate
/*.js
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=0, must-revalidate
/*.css
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=0, must-revalidate
/*.svg
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=0, must-revalidate

# The parquet files are the corpus, and they are meant to be queried from
# elsewhere: DuckDB reads them over HTTP with range requests. CORS is what makes
# that work from another origin, and Accept-Ranges is what keeps it from
# downloading 4.7 MB to answer a question about one year.
/data/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=3600, must-revalidate
  Access-Control-Allow-Origin: *
  Access-Control-Expose-Headers: Content-Length, Content-Range, Accept-Ranges

# Self-hosted type never changes under a given name.
/vendor/fonts/*.woff2
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable

# The site is read-only and static: no auth, no accounts, no third-party code.
#
# `script-src 'self'` and `style-src 'self'`, both without 'unsafe-inline': no
# inline script, no inline handler and no `style=""` attribute can run, which
# closes the main XSS vectors outright. `scripts/check_site.py` fails the build
# if a generated page would need any of them.
#
# One foreign origin is admitted, for one thing: `https://iiif.archive.org`
# under `img-src`. The engraved plates and the facsimile pages are served by
# the Internet Archive from the same scan this edition cites; they are images,
# loaded only when a reader asks for one, and nothing else may come from there.
/*
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=31536000
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'self'; script-src 'self'; style-src 'self'; font-src 'self'; img-src 'self' data: https://iiif.archive.org; connect-src 'self'; base-uri 'self'; form-action 'self'; frame-ancestors 'none'; object-src 'none'; upgrade-insecure-requests
  Permissions-Policy: camera=(), microphone=(), geolocation=(), payment=(), usb=(), interest-cohort=()
